WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
The grandson doesn’t dare, he just doesn’t dare to escape and disturb his grandmother’s rest

2
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:06,260
Did you know that your brother-in-law has caused trouble in the public office recently and has been criticized?

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,560
It was you who recommended him to serve in the public ministry.

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:12,760
Now that he is in trouble and his reputation has been damaged, you cannot escape the blame.

5
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,760
Didn’t my brother-in-law originally want to join the public service for training?

6
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:17,560
Now the public ministry has revealed

7
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,760
How can you indiscriminately blame everything on your husband?

8
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,760
As the saying goes, those who are lighthearted take themselves lightly.

9
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:25,260
If my brother-in-law is truly innocent and has no fault

10
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:27,260
Naturally, I can afford to thoroughly investigate the industry.

11
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:29,760
Why does grandma need to be so angry and worried?

12
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:32,880
Presumptuous, you are a junior wife

13
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:35,880
You know nothing about court affairs, so shut up

14
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:39,550
Grandma, what do you want to ask?

15
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:42,550
Just say it straight, don't beat around the bush

16
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:44,870
No need to embarrass others

17
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:47,090
Okay, then I'll ask you

18
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:49,190
did you do it on purpose
